," The marker, highlighter, and washi tape tools can add personality and emphasize important information on your board."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Sticky notes."})," Similar to physical sticky notes, stickies on FigJam can be placed anywhere on your board, offering a quick way to jot down ideas, notes, and to-dos or give feedback to team members."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Collaboration."})," FigJam offers tons of collaboration features, like comments, chats, stamps, stickers, and audio calls to keep teams engaged and connected."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"AI."})," FigJam\u2019s Generate tool saves time by creating mind maps, flowcharts, and other diagrams based on the given prompt."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Templates."})," FigJam has over 300 pre-made templates, from meeting notes and brainstorming to strategic planning and diagramming. These templates give you a starting point to organize ideas."]})]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"31-how-does-the-select-button-work",children:"How does the Select button work?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["When opening a FigJam whiteboard, the cursor that pops up by default is the Select tool. The Select tool allows you to select, move, and resize any objects on your board. Simply click on the object to select it and change its properties. To select multiple objects at once, click and drag your cursor around the items you want to select. You can also select an object, then hold down the Shift key on your keyboard and click any other items you want to select."," "]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"33-how-do-i-use-the-marker-tool",children:"How do I use the Marker tool?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})]}),(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"To use the Marker tool on your online whiteboard, click the marker icon on the bottom toolbar. Once selected, you can change the color and thickness to your liking. Use the marker to sketch wireframes, annotate designs, create doodles, or take meeting notes directly on your whiteboard."})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"34-what-are-figjams-ai-online-whiteboard-features",children:"What are FigJam\u2019s AI online whiteboard features?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Leverage the power of AI to help speed up and enhance your workflow with FigJam\u2019s"," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/ai/",children:"AI tools"}),"\u2014available on any team plan."," "]}),(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"Here are some ways to use FigJam\u2019s AI features on your online whiteboard."}),(0,o.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Generate boards and diagrams."})," Save time preparing meeting agendas or building diagrams with FigJam\u2019s Generate tool. Click the Generate button on the top right navigation bar, then type your prompt or use the prompt suggestions provided to create customized boards and diagrams."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Organize and summarize stickies."})," Sticky notes can get messy during long brainstorms and design retrospectives. To keep your team\u2019s notes organized and ensure action items are met, FigJam AI can sort your stickies by theme and give you a detailed summary of your notes."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Ideate with Jambot."})," Jambot is a"," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/widget/1274481464484630971",children:"FigJam widget"})," ","you can use to quickly brainstorm ideas, summarize meeting notes, create diagrams, reformat text, generate code, and more based on the prompt you provide."]})]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"35-how-do-sticky-notes-work",children:"How do sticky notes work?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Similar to physical sticky notes, stickies in FigJam are useful for any quick notes, to-do lists, and other thoughts you\u2019d like to add to your board."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Click the stack of stickies in the bottom toolbar or press S on your keyboard to add a sticky note to your board. Hover the sticky preview over the area you\u2019d like to stick your note, then click to drop the sticky."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Click the sticky note to adjust the font size, style, and formatting, and adjust the size of the sticky by dragging any of the corners. To edit a sticky note\u2019s color, select the sticky, then choose a color in the bottom toolbar. Sticky notes automatically include your name at the bottom, making it easier to view and sort notes during group meetings."," "]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"36-how-can-i-use-the-sticky-notes-feature-on-my-online-whiteboard",children:"How can I use the sticky notes feature on my online whiteboard?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["To use the sticky notes feature, click the stack of stickies in the bottom toolbar, then click the area you want to drop the sticky. Use the popup toolbar to edit the color, font, text size, and other text formatting on your sticky note."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Sticky notes are great for jotting down quick notes during meetings, leaving feedback on brainstorming ideas, or creating to-do lists to keep you and your team organized."," "]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"37-which-shapes-