igJam encourages users to contribute, offer feedback, and engage with team members in real time."," "]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"3-is-figjams-online-whiteboard-tool-free",children:"Is FigJam's online whiteboard tool free?"})," ",(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam is an online whiteboard that can be used for free forever with unlimited collaborators in three editable files. Paid plans start at just $5 per user per month, less than a third of the cost of Miro and Mural."," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam-vs-miro/",children:"Compare FigJam to Miro"}),"."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["To learn more about FigJam plans, visit the"," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/pricing/#figjam",children:"pricing page"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"4-are-online-whiteboards-only-for-brainstorming",children:"Are online whiteboards only for brainstorming?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t8})," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["Collaborative online whiteboards like FigJam make all types of activities more inclusive, productive, and fun, including"," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/diagramming-tool/",children:"diagramming"}),", journey mapping,"," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/strategic-planning/",children:"strategic planning"}),","," ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/agile-workflows/",children:"agile workflows"}),", and facilitating ",(0,o.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/team-meetings/",children:"team meetings"})," ","and workshops."]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:t7,id:"5-can-i-make-online-presentations-with-figjam",children:"Can I make online presentations with FigJam?"}),(0,o.jsx)(t